1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,600
Assalam-o-Alaikum! Your night shift at Constituency NA-47 has begun.

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:13,900
By 6:00 AM Fajr, you must take out all Form-45s, scan them on the left scanner, and upload them to the portal.

3
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:21,900
And yes... the final serial-number Forms are lost somewhere, so find them with the help of CCTV...

4
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:26,400
...but be careful that nobody sees you picking up the final Forms...

5
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:33,600
...if someone is there, wait for them to leave and then pick up the Forms.

6
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:40,300
The atmosphere outside gets a bit strange at night, so stay cautious...

7
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:48,200
...keep checking outside through the CCTV cameras and small windows, and do not scan when someone is spotted outside.

8
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:53,600
If someone comes near the door or window, lock the latch and close the shutter...

9
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:59,100
...and if needed, repair them using the hammer hanging on the wall.

10
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:04,900
Also, boil tea in the kettle on the right and keep sending it to Chacha Watchman at CAM 01 so he stays awake at the gate...

11
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:08,500
...and if there is a WiFi issue, check the router on CAM 10.

12
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:13,500
Remember, you have until 6:00 AM, so protect both the UPS battery and the Form-45s.

13
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:15,500
And yes... take care of yourself!
